@startuml 03-squad-class-diagram
title DAS squads: one DasSquad class, nine squad YAML files

package "k9_aif_abb (K9-AIF framework)" {
  abstract class BaseSquad {
    +execute(payload) : dict
    #before_step(agent_name, context)
  }
  class SquadLoader {
    +from_agents(...)
    +load_one(yaml_file, squad_id)
  }
}

package "k9_dow.squads" {
  class DasSquad {
    +before_step(agent_name, context)
    stops a withdrawn job
  }
  class "squad_layer(config)" as SL <<function>>
}

package "squads/yaml" {
  class ViewGenerationSquad <<yaml>> {
    ModelExtractorAgent
    ViewGeneratorAgent
    ViewConsistencyCheckerAgent
  }
  class GateReadinessSquad <<yaml>> {
    CriteriaLoaderAgent
    EvidenceCollectorAgent
    ReadinessScorerAgent
    GapReporterAgent
  }
  class PackageAssemblySquad <<yaml>> {
    ArtifactFetcherAgent
    CompletenessCheckerAgent
    PackageBuilderAgent
  }
  class JointReviewSquad <<yaml>> {
    JsdRecommenderAgent
  }
  class MddPackageSquad <<yaml>> {
    AoaStudyPlanAgent
  }
  class MsaAnalysisSquad <<yaml>> {
    AoaSummaryAgent
    AlternativeSystemsReviewAgent
    AcquisitionStrategyAgent
  }
  class SrrPackageSquad <<yaml>> {
    SystemRequirementsAgent
  }
  class TraceabilitySquad <<yaml>> {
    LinkProposerAgent
    LinkValidatorAgent
    OrphanDetectorAgent
    CoverageScorerAgent
  }
  class DriftDetectionSquad <<yaml>> {
    BaselineDifferAgent
    FundingDifferAgent
    DriftClassifierAgent
  }
}

BaseSquad <|-- DasSquad
SL --> SquadLoader : builds once at the entry point
SquadLoader --> DasSquad : one instance per squad
DasSquad ..> ViewGenerationSquad
DasSquad ..> GateReadinessSquad
DasSquad ..> PackageAssemblySquad
DasSquad ..> JointReviewSquad
DasSquad ..> MddPackageSquad
DasSquad ..> MsaAnalysisSquad
DasSquad ..> SrrPackageSquad
DasSquad ..> TraceabilitySquad
DasSquad ..> DriftDetectionSquad

note bottom of GateReadinessSquad
  Used by every gate (ProcessStageOrchestrator.prepare_gate),
  followed by PackageAssemblySquad.
  Requirement run: ViewGeneration, GateReadiness, PackageAssembly, JointReview.
  MDD package run: MddPackage. MSA run: MsaAnalysis. TMRR run: SrrPackage.
end note
@enduml
